---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Sobre o estagio.io | Agregador de Vagas de Estágio"
  description="O estagio.io monitora os principais portais de carreira do Brasil e reúne tudo em um só lugar."
>
  <style>
    .hero-gradient {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0, 112, 243, 0.05) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
    }
    .dark .hero-gradient {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0, 112, 243, 0.15) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0) 70%);
    }
  </style>

  <!-- 1. Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-gradient py-xl md:py-32 px-gutter">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-md fade-in-section">
      <h1 class="font-display text-display md:text-[64px] leading-tight tracking-tight text-on-surface">
        Chega de abrir 15 abas atrás de estágio.
      </h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        O estagio.io monitora os principais portais de carreira do Brasil e reúne tudo em um só lugar — pra você não perder nenhuma vaga boa por falta de tempo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. O problema (seção nova) -->
  <section class="py-xl px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-xl md:p-12 space-y-md fade-in-section">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-[16px]">help_outline</span>
        Por que existimos
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
        Boas vagas somem rápido — e você não pode ficar em 10 sites por dia
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Toda semana surgem centenas de vagas de estágio espalhadas em diversas plataformas de carreira. As melhores recebem candidaturas em poucas horas. Pra maioria dos estudantes, simplesmente não dá tempo de acompanhar tudo isso — entre faculdade, trabalho e vida pessoal.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Nossa Missão (ajustada) -->
  <section class="py-xl px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-xl items-center fade-in-section">
      <div class="space-y-lg order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-[16px]">flag</span>
          Nossa Missão
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Todas as vagas em um só lugar</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          O estagio.io é um agregador que monitora as principais plataformas de carreira para que você não precise visitar dezenas de sites todos os dias.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Nossa plataforma centraliza e organiza as oportunidades, permitindo que você encontre seu próximo estágio de forma rápida, eficiente e totalmente gratuita.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low p-xl flex flex-col justify-center gap-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant aspect-square md:aspect-video">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">work</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">10.000+</div>
            <div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant">Vagas Agregadas</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">travel_explore</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">15+</div>
            <div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant">Plataformas Monitoradas</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">100%</div>
            <div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant">Gratuito para Alunos</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. Como funcionamos -->
  <section class="py-xl px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-on-secondary-fixed dark:bg-slate-900 dark:border dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-xl md:p-24 text-on-primary relative overflow-hidden fade-in-section">
      <!-- Abstract pattern overlay -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="180" stroke="white" stroke-dasharray="10 10" stroke-width="2"></circle>
          <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="140" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"></circle>
          <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="100" stroke="white" stroke-dasharray="5 5" stroke-width="2"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
        <h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg md:text-[40px] text-white mb-md">Como funcionamos?</h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary-fixed-dim mb-lg">
          Nosso sistema realiza uma varredura constante nas principais plataformas de carreira do mercado brasileiro.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-md items-center mb-xl">
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md border border-white/20">Plataformas de Carreira</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md border border-white/20">Portais de Estágio</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md border border-white/20">Redes Profissionais</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md border border-white/20">15+ fontes integradas</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary-fixed-dim">
          Isso garante que você não perca nenhuma oportunidade relevante. Organizamos tudo de forma limpa, permitindo filtros avançados por localização, bolsa-auxílio e modalidade.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Criado por -->
  <section class="py-xl px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto fade-in-section">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-xl md:p-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-lg">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-[16px]">person</span>
        Criado por
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-lg">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-[32px]">account_circle</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <p class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Fredson Santos</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-md mt-md">
            <a
              href="https://linkedin.com/in/fredsonsantos"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-md text-label-md text-primary hover:underline transition-colors"
              aria-label="Ver perfil no LinkedIn"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
              </svg>
              linkedin.com/in/fredsonsantos
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/Fredson-Santos"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-md text-label-md text-primary hover:underline transition-colors"
              aria-label="Ver perfil no GitHub"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/>
              </svg>
              github.com/Fredson-Santos
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. CTA final -->
  <section class="py-xl text-center px-gutter fade-in-section">
    <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-md text-on-surface">Pronto para dar o próximo passo?</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-md justify-center items-center">
      <a class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors shadow-lg" href="/vagas">Ver vagas disponíveis</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const observerOptions = {
      threshold: 0.1
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
          entry.target.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-10');
        }
      });
    }, observerOptions);

    document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in-section').forEach(el => {
      el.classList.add('transition-all', 'duration-1000', 'opacity-0', 'translate-y-10');
      observer.observe(el);
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
